notes:
The token is the ONLY blocker. Every other clause on this card is expressible with the vocabulary in the packet, and it is verified against shipped cards: the trigger half matches Keeper of the Accord's `{"event": "end_step", "controller": "opponent", "condition": {...}}`, and the activation gate matches Bloodline Keeper's `condition` on an activated ability (a `cmp` with `counters_on`). Swap the token id in below the moment `angel_4_4_w_flying` exists and the answer is complete:

{
  "card": {
    "id": "luminarch_ascension",
    "name": "Luminarch Ascension",
    "oracle_text": "At the beginning of each opponent's end step, if you didn't lose life this turn, you may put a quest counter on this enchantment. (Damage causes loss of life.)\n{1}{W}: Create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying. Activate only if this enchantment has four or more quest counters on it.",
    "mana_cost": "{1}{W}",
    "types": ["Enchantment"],
    "colors": ["W"],
    "color_identity": ["W"],
    "abilities": [
      {
        "kind": "triggered",
        "text": "At the beginning of each opponent's end step, if you didn't lose life this turn, you may put a quest counter on this enchantment. (Damage causes loss of life.)",
        "trigger": {
          "event": "end_step",
          "controller": "opponent",
          "condition": {
            "cmp": "<=",
            "left": {"life_lost_this_turn": "you"},
            "right": {"const": 0}
          }
        },
        "effects": [
          {
            "op": "may",
            "prompt": "Put a quest counter on Luminarch Ascension?",
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "add_counters",
                "counter": "quest",
                "amount": {"const": 1},
                "objects": {"self_only": true}
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "activated",
        "text": "{1}{W}: Create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying. Activate only if this enchantment has four or more quest counters on it.",
        "cost": {"mana": "{1}{W}"},
        "condition": {
          "cmp": ">=",
          "left": {"counters_on": {"counter": "quest", "objects": {"self_only": true}}},
          "right": {"const": 4}
        },
        "effects": [
          {"op": "create_token", "token": "angel_4_4_w_flying", "amount": {"const": 1}}
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "expectation": {"zone": "battlefield", "battlefield_count": 33}
}

The expectation is the weak-fallback shape on purpose: the harness casts the enchantment and stops, so the activated ability never fires (no Angel token to assert) and the end-step trigger never fires either (the sandbox stops in your own precombat main). `battlefield_count` 33 is the 32 starting permanents plus the enchantment itself.
